## Third-party data and services

This project displays data from third-party sources (Esri, CORINE Land
Cover / Copernicus, HILDA+, HYDE, LUH2, LUCAS, GRPK, and the Lithuanian
Hydrometeorological Service's api.meteo.lt) — each remains subject to its
own original license/terms of use; this LICENSE covers only the code and
original work in this repository, not the underlying third-party datasets.

